ouse's 4D allows their customers to live an unequalled virtual reality technological experience.", "short_description": "A 4D virtual reality experience unique in Europe and developed by K\u00fcchenHouse Kitchens, which allows you to enter a 100% interactive shop and see your new kitchen, bathroom or dressing room from the sofa in your home. A unique shopping experience. You decide, on the street or from your Oculus Quest."}]}, "developer_name": "L\u00e3berit Sistemas S.L.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.kuchenhouse.com/politica-de-privacidad/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "L\u00e3berit Sistemas S.L.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.kuchenhouse.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "961317924486784"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1826111418260092"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "195710946075481"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1826111418260092"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1754900400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1826111418260092"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "8325927724149218", "version": "2.00"}, "id": "509571100106855", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_onl